ure tests only customer lookup. Use full resource fixtures for other\noperations; SDK types do not validate them at runtime.",[921,922,924],"h2",{"id":923},"test-your-storage-boundary","Test your storage boundary",[428,926,927,928,932,933,665],{},"Check the ",[929,930,931],"a",{"href":285},"storage contracts",": uniqueness under concurrency,\ntest\u002Flive separation, omitted versus null updates, and a declined ",[432,934,935],{},"store",[428,937,938,939,942],{},"For ",[929,940,941],{"href":277},"webhooks",", test valid, invalid, stale, and rotated signatures\nusing an independent HMAC signer. Concurrent copies must commit once. A failed\nreaction must roll back rows, audit markers, and outbox work, then succeed on retry.\nAlso test unknown events and out-of-order snapshots. Keep timestamp checks enabled.",[921,944,946],{"id":945},"live-test-mode-workflow","Live test-mode workflow",[948,949,950,962,968,983],"ol",{},[951,952,953,954,957,958,961],"li",{},"Set ",[432,955,956],{},"VATLY_API_KEY"," to a real ",[432,959,960],{},"test_"," key. Use customer and catalogue IDs from\nits storefront and mode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[951,963,964,965,665],{},"Expose your local webhook route through an HTTPS tunnel. Register the public\nURL and save its signing secret as ",[432,966,967],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[951,969,970,971,974,975,978,979,982],{},"Pay through a ",[929,972,973],{"href":267},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[432,976,977],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[432,980,981],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[951,984,985],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[428,987,988,991,992,995,996,591,999,995,1002,995,1005,1008,1009,1012,1013,1016],{},[432,989,990],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[432,993,994],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[432,997,998],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[432,1000,1001],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[432,1003,1004],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[432,1006,1007],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[432,1010,1011],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[432,1014,1015],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[921,1018,1020],{"id":1019},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[428,1022,1023],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[428,1025,1026,1027,1033,1034,665],{},"See the ",[929,1028,1032],{"href":1029,"rel":1030},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[1031],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[929,1035,1038],{"href":1036,"rel":1037},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[1031],"Test Helpers API reference",[1040,1041,1042],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dar